<Meta of={UnopsButtonStories} />

<Title />

The `unops-button` is used to provide buton functionality.

The component supports primary, secondary, tertiary, affirmative, warning and destructive variants.

## Table of Contents

- [Examples](#examples)
- [Properties](#properties)

---

## Examples

### Button

